---
// The QA skill's showcase, and the reference implementation every other skill
// diagram should follow.
//
// Two rules it establishes:
//   1. Each step is a `.hotspot` group carrying `data-detail`, which must match
//      an `id` in the card's `details` frontmatter. Card.astro's script pairs
//      them: click a step and the flow write-up opens, scrolled to that step.
//   2. It shares the `.topology` classes with every other diagram so they read
//      as one visual language and track the theme.
//
// Source facts: src/content/cards/qa.md, docs/context/testing.md.
---

<figure class="card-diagram">
  <div class="card-diagram-scroll">
    <svg
      class="topology"
      viewBox="0 0 820 300"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="qa-loop-title qa-loop-desc"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      fill="none"
    >
      <title id="qa-loop-title">How work gets checked before it counts as finished</title>
      <desc id="qa-loop-desc">
        A five-step cycle. One: write down what finished means, before any work
        starts. Two: the coding agent builds it, and only builds it. Three:
        automated checks run first, so failures bounce back before a human looks.
        Four: I check the result against what was written in step one, and
        anything that does not match goes back with specifics and returns to step
        two. Five: only once the goal is actually reached does the written
        documentation get updated.
      </desc>

      <defs>
        <marker id="qa-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path class="arrow-head" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" stroke="none" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- the return leg, drawn above the row so it never crosses the flow -->
      <path class="link ephemeral-link" d="M716,76 L716,46 L308,46 L308,76" marker-end="url(#qa-arrow)" />
      <text class="wire" x="512" y="38" text-anchor="middle">sent back with specifics — and round it goes again</text>

      <g class="hotspot" data-detail="requirement" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Step 1, write down what finished means — open the explanation">
        <rect class="node" x="15" y="76" width="178" height="80" rx="10" />
        <text class="label" x="29" y="100">1 · Write it down</text>
        <text class="sub" x="29" y="118">what finished means,</text>
        <text class="sub" x="29" y="134">before anything starts</text>
      </g>

      <path class="link" d="M195,116 L217,116" marker-end="url(#qa-arrow)" />

      <g class="hotspot" data-detail="implement" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Step 2, the agent builds it — open the explanation">
        <rect class="node" x="219" y="76" width="178" height="80" rx="10" />
        <text class="label" x="233" y="100">2 · Agent builds</text>
        <text class="sub" x="233" y="118">it builds, and that is</text>
        <text class="sub" x="233" y="134">the whole of its job</text>
      </g>

      <path class="link" d="M399,116 L421,116" marker-end="url(#qa-arrow)" />

      <g class="hotspot" data-detail="gates" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Step 3, the machine checks first — open the explanation">
        <rect class="node" x="423" y="76" width="178" height="80" rx="10" />
        <text class="label" x="437" y="100">3 · Machine checks</text>
        <text class="sub" x="437" y="118">builds, tests, and what</text>
        <text class="sub" x="437" y="134">changed — before I look</text>
      </g>

      <path class="link" d="M603,116 L625,116" marker-end="url(#qa-arrow)" />

      <g class="hotspot" data-detail="verify" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Step 4, then I check it — open the explanation">
        <rect class="node" x="627" y="76" width="178" height="80" rx="10" />
        <text class="label" x="641" y="100">4 · Then I check</text>
        <text class="sub" x="641" y="118">against what step one</text>
        <text class="sub" x="641" y="134">said, not how it looks</text>
      </g>

      <path class="link" d="M716,156 L716,206" marker-end="url(#qa-arrow)" />
      <text class="wire accent" x="726" y="186">it matches</text>

      <g class="hotspot" data-detail="docs" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Step 5, write it up last — open the explanation">
        <rect class="node" x="627" y="206" width="178" height="70" rx="10" />
        <text class="label" x="641" y="230">5 · Write it up</text>
        <text class="sub" x="641" y="248">last, once it is really</text>
        <text class="sub" x="641" y="264">done — never before</text>
      </g>

      <text class="wire accent" x="15" y="234">nothing is approved by whoever built it</text>
      <text class="wire" x="15" y="254">the same rule an engineering team runs on — it does not</text>
      <text class="wire" x="15" y="270">stop applying because the builder is a machine</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="card-diagram-caption">
    Click any step to read what it means.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
